    # "Lifeless bodies fell to the floor, one upon another, torn to shreds by tooth and claw as both me and Markus greedily began to rip apart and devour pieces of their flesh."
    "Corpos sem vida caíram no chão, uns sobre os outros, dilacerados por dentes e garras enquanto Markus e eu, vorazmente, começávamos a despedaçar e devorar pedaços de sua carne."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_3.rpy:118
translate ptPT qst_DamzelDizzt_3_ruckus_TarekDead_d5cfc95c:

